af:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Sales\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/first-quarter-2024-sales\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>First quarter 2024 sales</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/first-quarter-2024-sales\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2024-04-18T16:00:00Z\">18 April 2024</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pastefromword field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">\nA VERY GOOD START TO THE YEARHIGH SINGLE DIGIT RHYTHM MAINTAINED\n&nbsp;\n\nSales: 11.24 billion euros, +9.4% like-for-like1, +8.3% reported.\nFirst quarter sales included a positive 130 million euro phasing impact ahead of the implementation of new IT systems in North America. Adjusted like-for-like growth amounted to a strong +8.1%.</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/annual-general-meeting-be-held-tuesday-23-april-2024-and-2023-universal-registration\" aria-label=\"Annual General Meeting to be held on Tuesday 23 April 2024 and 2023 Universal Registration Document\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n  