th-summary field__item\">\n&nbsp;\nSales up +18.0%1\nat the end of September\nStrengthened growth dynamic&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n\nSales: 23.19 billion euros\n\n+18.0% like-for-like1\n+18.8% at constant exchange rates\n+15.3% based on reported figures\n\n\nGrowth acceleration over two years: +14.9% like-for-like in the third quarter compared with 2019</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2021-half-year-financial-report\" aria-label=\"2021 Half-Year Financial Report\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2021-03/My_Way_Rapport_Annuel_2%2C276_1366x600pixels_RVB_300dpi_web_only.jpg?h=31a3d994&amp;itok=Dpme4MJb\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"\u00c9g\u00e9rie Rapport Annuel 2020\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Document publications\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2021-half-year-financial-report\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>2021 Half-Year Financial Report</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2021-half-year-financial-report\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ne