         Other financial information\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-announcing-launch-its-third-employee-share-ownership-plan\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>L\u2019Or\u00e9al is announcing the launch of its third Employee Share Ownership Plan.</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-announcing-launch-its-third-employee-share-ownership-plan\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2022-05-17T16:00:00Z\">17 May 2022</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pastefromword field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">L\u2019Or\u00e9al is announcing the launch of its third Employee Share Ownership Plan.\nThe plan will be rolled out in 63 countries and will give L\u2019Or\u00e9al employees, in France and internationally, the possibility to be even more closely linked to the Group\u2019s development.</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/annual-general-meeting-and-board-directors-meeting-21-april-2022\" aria-label=\"Annual General Meeting and Board of Directors\u2019 Meeting of 21 April 2022\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2022-02/egerie2022_test4.jpg?h=e5d59f97&amp;itok