8.0% like-for-like 1\n+8.8% at constant exchange rates\n+10.9% based on reported figures\n\n\nOperating profit: 5.54 billion euros, an increase of +12.7% 2</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-enters-exclusive-negotiation-sale-its-roger-gallet-brand\" aria-label=\"L\u2019Or\u00e9al enters in exclusive negotiation  for the sale of its Roger &amp;amp; Gallet brand\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_0.jpg?itok=5PtQCL2L\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"L'Or\u00e9al logo cercle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Acquisitions\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-very-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-enters-exclusive-negotiation-sale-its-roger-gallet-brand\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>L\u2019Or\u00e9al enters in exclusive negotiation  for the sale of its Roger &amp; Gallet brand</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-enters-exclusive-negotiation-sale-its-roger-gallet-brand\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2020-02-04T17:00:00Z\">04 February 2020</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pastefromword field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">\n\n   Clichy, 4 February 2020 \u2013 Following a strategic review regarding the best development options for the Roger &amp; Gallet brand, L\u2019Or\u00e9al announces that it has entered in exclusive negotiation with the French investment holding Impala for the sale of Roger &amp; Gallet brand.</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/prada-and-loreal-announce-signing-long-term-license-agreement\" aria-label=\"Prada and L&amp;#039;Or\u00e9al announce the signing of a long-term license agreement\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_0.jpg?itok=5PtQCL2L\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"L'Or\u00e9al logo cercle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Acquisitions\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/prada-and-loreal-announce-signing-long-term-license-agreement\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>Prada and L'Or\u00e9al announce the signing of a long-term license agreement</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/prada-and-loreal-announce-signing-long-term-license-agreement\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2019-12-12T07:30:00Z\">12 December 2019</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pastefromword field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">\n\n\nMilan and Clichy, 12 December 2019, 08.30 AM CET - Prada S.p.A. and L'Or\u00e9al announce the signing of a long-term license agreement for the creation, development and distribution of luxury beauty products for the Prada brand. This agreement will allow the two companies to combine their expertise in each of their own sectors.</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/sales-30-september-2019\" aria-label=\"Sales at 30 September 2019\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/publication-content/images/egerie_863-533.png?itok=Grr2_ct6\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"L'Or\u00e9al Finance - Beauty, a value for the future\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Sales\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/sales-30-september-2019\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>Sales at 30 September 2019</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/sales-30-september-2019\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2019-10-29T17:00:00Z\">29 October 2019</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pastefromword field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">\n\nStrong rhythm of growth maintained\n\nSales: 21.99 billion euros\n\n+7.5% like-for-like 1\n+8.5% at constant exchange rates\n+10.7% based on reported figures\n\n\nStrong growth of L\u2019Or\u00e9al Luxe and Active Cosmetics Divisions\nMain growth drivers remain dynamic: Asia Pacific, skincare, Travel Retail and e-commerce\n\nListen &nbsp;to the conference call</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-signs-agreement-acquisition-mugler-and-azzaro-fragrances-clarins-group\" aria-label=\"L\u2019Or\u00e9al signs an agreement for the acquisition of Mugler and Azzaro fragrances from Clarins Group\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo.jpg?itok=9WovmwXC\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al cercle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Acquisitions\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-very-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-signs-agreement-acquisition-mugler-and-azzaro-fragrances-clarins-group\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>L\u2019Or\u00e9al signs an agreement for the acquisition of Mugler and Azzaro fragrances from Clarins Group</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-signs-agreement-acquisition-mugler-and-azzaro-fragrances-clarins-group\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2019-10-21T16:00:00Z\">21 October 2019</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">\nClichy, 21 October 2019 6PM - Following consultation with employee representatives of both parties, L\u2019Or\u00e9al and Clarins Group signed an agreement for the sale of the Mugler brands and Azzaro fragrances through the acquisition of the fragrance division of Clarins by L\u2019Or\u00e9al.</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-concludes-settlement-french-tax-authorities\" aria-label=\"L&amp;#039;Or\u00e9al concludes a settlement with the French tax authorities\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo.jpg?itok=9WovmwXC\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al cercle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Other financial information\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-concludes-settlement-french-tax-authorities\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>L'Or\u00e9al concludes a settlement with the French tax authorities</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-concludes-settlement-french-tax-authorities\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2019-09-20T07:00:00Z\">20 September 2019</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">L'Or\u00e9al&nbsp;informs about the conclusion, today, of constructive discussions with the French tax authorities concerning the tax base of its subsidiairies Lanc\u00f4me Parfums et Beaut\u00e9, Cosmetique Active International and Prestige &amp; Collections International, for fiscal years 2014 to 2018, without &nbsp;incurring&nbsp;tax penalties.&nbsp;</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n