ensed consolidated financial statements at 30 June 2019;</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"views-row\">\n<div class=\"nodetype--publication news-events-listing__item\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2019-half-year-results\" aria-label=\"2019 Half-Year results\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2019-10/alaune_3_7_30_2019_9_57_33AM_0.jpg?h=1b58a095&amp;itok=H1UgoZuC\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Alaune\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Results\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2019-half-year-results\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>2019 Half-Year results</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2019-half-year-results\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2019-07-30T10:11:11Z\">30 July 2019</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">Strong growth continues: +7.3%&nbsp;1\nSubstantial increase in operating profit: +12.1%&nbsp;2\n\nSales: 14.81 billion euros\n\n+7.3% like-for