    "<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-finalizes-acquisition-niely-cosmeticos-group-brazil\" aria-label=\"L&amp;#039;Or\u00e9al finalizes the acquisition of Niely Cosmeticos group in Brazil\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/publication-content/images/Niely_Gold_paysage.jpg?itok=0TgJPrk6\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\" L'Or\u00e9al Finance - Beauty, a value for the future\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" alt=\"\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Acquisitions\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-finalizes-acquisition-niely-cosmeticos-group-brazil\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>L'Or\u00e9al finalizes the acquisition of Niely Cosmeticos group in Brazil</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-finalizes-acquisition-niely-cosmeticos-group-brazil\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2015-03-31T16:00:00Z\">31 March 2015</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">L\u2019Or\u00e9al&nbsp;announced today that it has finalized the acquisition of&nbsp;Niely Cosmeticos&nbsp;in Brazil. Niely Cosmeticos is the largest independent hair coloration and hair care company in Brazil, one of the world\u2019s largest hair color and hair care markets.&nbsp;\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
    "<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/annual-general-meeting-april-22-2015-2014-registration-document\" aria-label=\"Annual General Meeting of April 22, 2015 / 2014 Registration Document\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_9.jpg?itok=CmolWVzx\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al circle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Annual General Meeting\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/annual-general-meeting-april-22-2015-2014-registration-document\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>Annual General Meeting of April 22, 2015 / 2014 Registration Document</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/annual-general-meeting-april-22-2015-2014-registration-document\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2015-03-19T17:00:00Z\">19 March 2015</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">Information available concerning the Annual General Meeting to be held on Wednesday, April 22, 2015 and the 2014 Registration Document.\nANNUAL GENERAL MEETING SET FOR APRIL 22, 2014:</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
    "<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-and-cfao-sign-production-and-distribution-partnership-ivory-coast\" aria-label=\"L&amp;#039;Or\u00e9al and CFAO sign a production and distribution partnership for Ivory Coast\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_9.jpg?itok=CmolWVzx\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al circle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Other financial information\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-very-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-and-cfao-sign-production-and-distribution-partnership-ivory-coast\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>L'Or\u00e9al and CFAO sign a production and distribution partnership for Ivory Coast</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-and-cfao-sign-production-and-distribution-partnership-ivory-coast\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2015-03-06T17:00:00Z\">06 March 2015</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">6 March 2015 - L'Or\u00e9al and CFAO announced today the signing of a protocol agreement covering the production and distribution of cosmetic products in Ivory Coast. </div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
    "<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2014-annual-results\" aria-label=\"2014 Annual Results\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_9.jpg?itok=CmolWVzx\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al circle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Results\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2014-annual-results\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>2014 Annual Results</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2014-annual-results\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2015-02-12T17:00:00Z\">12 February 2015</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">Growth in all Divisions and all Geographic Zones\nRecord operating margin\nStrong growth in net profit\n\nSales: 22.53 billion euros&nbsp;\n\n+3.7% like-for-like\n+1.8% based on reported figures\n+4.1% at constant exchange rates\n\nOperating profit: 3.891 billion euros, representing 17.3% of sales</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
