    "<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-announces-reunification-roles-chairman-board-directors-and-chief-executive\" aria-label=\"L\u2019Or\u00e9al announces the reunification of the roles of Chairman of the Board of Directors and Chief Executive Officer of the Group. Jean-Paul Agon appointed Chairman and CEO, Sir Lindsay Owen-Jones Honorary Chairman\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_9.jpg?itok=CmolWVzx\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al circle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Governance\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-very-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-announces-reunification-roles-chairman-board-directors-and-chief-executive\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>L\u2019Or\u00e9al announces the reunification of the roles of Chairman of the Board of Directors and Chief Executive Officer of the Group. Jean-Paul Agon appointed Chairman and CEO, Sir Lindsay Owen-Jones Honorary Chairman </span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-announces-reunification-roles-chairman-board-directors-and-chief-executive\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2011-02-10T18:00:00Z\">10 February 2011</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">Sir Lindsay Owen-Jones informed the Appointments and Governance Committee, at its meeting on February 9th ,2011, and then the Board of Directors, at its meeting on February 10th ,2011, that he wished to complete the transfer of responsibilities to his successor before his 65th birthday on&nbsp; March 17th 2011, as planned from the outset and announ</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
    "<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2010-annual-results\" aria-label=\"2010 Annual Results\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_9.jpg?itok=CmolWVzx\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al circle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Results\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2010-annual-results\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>2010 Annual Results</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/2010-annual-results\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2011-02-10T17:00:00Z\">10 February 2011</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">STRONG GROWTH\nIN SALES AND PROFITS\n\n2010 sales: 19.5 billion euros\n\n+11.6% based on reported figures\n+5.6% like-for-like\n\n\nOperating profit: +18.6%\nNet earnings per share*: +17.2%\nConfidence in a new year of sales and profit growth\nIncrease in dividend**: +20% at 1.80 euro\n</div>\n      \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
    "<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-usa-acquires-peels-salon-services-extending-its-coverage-american-hair-salons\" aria-label=\"L&amp;#039;Or\u00e9al USA acquires Peel\u2019s Salon Services extending its coverage of American hair salons\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_9.jpg?itok=CmolWVzx\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al circle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Acquisitions\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"title-very-small news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-usa-acquires-peels-salon-services-extending-its-coverage-american-hair-salons\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>L'Or\u00e9al USA acquires Peel\u2019s Salon Services extending its coverage of American hair salons</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/loreal-usa-acquires-peels-salon-services-extending-its-coverage-american-hair-salons\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2010-12-13T17:00:00Z\">13 December 2010</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\"