    "<div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 col-xl-2 offset-xl-2 news-events-listing__image-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__image\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/first-half-2010-results\" aria-label=\"First-half 2010 Results\">\n                      <article role=\"presentation\">\n  \n      \n            <div class=\"field image field--type-image field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail_150_150/public/2020-10/Logo_9.jpg?itok=CmolWVzx\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" alt=\"\" title=\"Logo L'Or\u00e9al circle\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\">\n\n\n</div>\n      \n  </article>\n\n                  </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-7 col-xl-6 offset-lg-0 offset-xl-0 news-events-listing__info-wrapper\">\n              <div class=\"news-events-listing__topic\">\n          Results\n        </div>\n            <div class=\"news-events-listing__title\">\n        <a href=\"/eng/news-release/first-half-2010-results\" data-once=\"datalayer\"><span>First-half 2010 Results</span>\n</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__info\">\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__type\">\n          <a href=\"/eng/news-release/first-half-2010-results\">News release</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"news-events-listing__date\">\n          <time datetime=\"2010-08-25T16:00:00Z\">25 August 2010</time>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"news-events-listing__body\">\n        \n            <div class=\"field body field--type-text-with-summary field__item\">Strong increase in first-half results\nHigh level of operating margin at 17.3% of salesStrong increase in results:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - Operating profit: +21.4%\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - EPS*: +15.3% at 2.39 euros\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - Cash flow**: +20.9%\nGood quality results:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - Significant improvement in gross profit</div>\n      \n      </di